WEBVTT

00:06.680 --> 00:10.020
I am Bell Cranel of the Hestia Familia.

00:10.410 --> 00:11.950
And no one else.

00:12.720 --> 00:14.180
I won't waver anymore.

00:14.180 --> 00:14.910
But...

00:15.250 --> 00:16.780
What do I do now?

00:17.580 --> 00:21.630
If I see Lady Freya now,
she'll notice that I've changed.

00:22.380 --> 00:26.840
Even if Orario turned wild
because of Lady Freya's charm,

00:27.230 --> 00:31.240
how is it that everyone
forget only about Syr?

00:35.880 --> 00:38.430
An explosion? Is it magic?

00:39.030 --> 00:41.710
Bell? Are you there? Bell!

00:41.710 --> 00:42.650
Thank goodness...

00:43.080 --> 00:44.650
What's going on?

00:44.650 --> 00:49.650
A bandit. They have punched
through the holy Folkvangr.

00:49.650 --> 00:50.860
And they're just alone...

00:50.860 --> 00:53.990
Alone?! They breached
through the Familia alone?!

00:53.990 --> 00:54.780
What's going on?!

00:54.780 --> 00:56.480
What just exploded?!

01:02.960 --> 01:06.960
VESTA

01:11.430 --> 01:13.100
It's Gale! Don't let her get away!

01:13.100 --> 01:14.550
Get her!

01:14.970 --> 01:16.260
I already figured it out...

01:16.930 --> 01:20.880
But this is really
Freya Familia's home, Folkvangr.

01:24.440 --> 01:26.650
All the enemies here are strong!

01:31.490 --> 01:34.320
Compatriot, how did you escape
the underground room?!

01:38.810 --> 01:41.290
Wreak havoc in this mansion.

01:41.820 --> 01:44.000
That's my condition of setting you free.

01:45.910 --> 01:48.800
So you're telling me to obey you
without questions?

01:49.230 --> 01:50.930
Who are you?

01:52.820 --> 01:54.260
Please, Ryu.

01:55.810 --> 01:57.980
I can't even fathom this myself.

01:57.980 --> 02:01.140
I don't know her true motive,
but I'm doing as she told...

02:03.100 --> 02:06.340
But those eyes...
Those words...

02:06.770 --> 02:10.070
Imbue the light of stardust
and destroy the enemy.

02:10.070 --> 02:11.960
Luminous Wind!

02:14.710 --> 02:17.620
Anyway, don't leave this room at all.

02:18.050 --> 02:20.620
I'll put some guards on your door.
Got it?

02:22.340 --> 02:24.900
Bell, listen to Heith.

02:24.900 --> 02:27.560
She also likes you.

02:27.560 --> 02:32.280
This attack might have something
to do with your curse.

02:32.870 --> 02:34.430
Okay.

02:39.850 --> 02:43.970
So they don't want me
to encounter the intruder?

02:45.770 --> 02:49.480
I'm in my room, and Heith
seemed to be relieved for that.

02:49.480 --> 02:52.650
I know someone's trying to rescue me.

02:52.650 --> 02:53.740
But who?

03:08.940 --> 03:10.500
An explosion at our home?!

03:10.500 --> 03:15.220
Y-Yes. It wasn't an attack from outside,
but an explosion spell from inside...

03:15.560 --> 03:16.900
Is it Gale?!

03:16.900 --> 03:20.560
What are the boar and elf doing?!

03:20.560 --> 03:22.800
Bad news, Lord Allen!

03:22.800 --> 03:24.770
Now what?!

03:25.570 --> 03:27.870
The individual we put on standby at Babel...

03:28.650 --> 03:30.020
That person isn't there!

03:30.990 --> 03:32.400
We're pulling back!

03:36.230 --> 03:37.970
Delivery complete!

03:37.970 --> 03:41.930
I also put on fire in the fireplace,
as Lord Hermes instructed.

03:41.930 --> 03:43.160
Well done.

03:44.850 --> 03:47.090
Even though this is a quest
from the Guild,

03:47.090 --> 03:50.790
I can't believe Lord Hermes
agreed for us to contribute to society...

03:50.790 --> 03:54.640
He also told us specifically to deliver
according to the order on the map.

03:54.640 --> 03:56.300
What a pain.

03:56.700 --> 03:58.760
Not to mention, this firewood...

04:00.410 --> 04:03.620
It really reeks blood.

04:03.620 --> 04:04.720
Why's that?

04:06.050 --> 04:08.980
Perhaps it's a crime weapon used
to bonk someone in the head?

04:08.980 --> 04:11.740
That's it! Burn it down,
and there goes your evidence!

04:11.740 --> 04:14.250
Enough yapping.
Let's go.

04:40.310 --> 04:41.550
Horn?

04:44.920 --> 04:47.390
How much answer have you got?

04:49.970 --> 04:52.820
I am Bell Cranel of the Hestia Familia.

04:53.690 --> 04:55.610
I don't belong in the Freya Familia.

04:56.370 --> 04:58.570
So how much have you noticed?

05:00.230 --> 05:02.430
Of what?

05:02.430 --> 05:05.380
Are you talking about
the charm of Orario, or...

05:05.380 --> 05:06.370
Scum...

05:06.700 --> 05:10.290
Scum, scum, scum...

05:10.290 --> 05:13.230
Scum, scum, scum!

05:13.230 --> 05:15.910
You bewildered her,
made her suffer...

05:15.910 --> 05:17.760
but you still don't understand anything!

05:17.760 --> 05:19.720
You're worse than scum!

05:19.720 --> 05:22.720
How dense can you be?!

05:22.720 --> 05:24.900
You're a beast acting oh-so-harmless!

05:24.900 --> 05:27.830
A monster who mistakes
insensitivity for loyalty!

05:27.830 --> 05:29.430
The filth of humanity!

05:29.850 --> 05:33.100
A sinful pest who only
seduces older women!

05:33.100 --> 05:36.650
You even deceived the sublime Goddess!
Know your place!

05:36.960 --> 05:41.630
Unforgivable...
Unforgivable... Unforgivable!

05:41.630 --> 05:44.190
That foolish face,
and that pitiful voice...

05:44.190 --> 05:46.410
The kindness that makes her suffer...

05:46.410 --> 05:48.450
Everything about you is a sin!

05:49.920 --> 05:52.620
I should've killed you!

05:52.620 --> 05:55.730
Since you appeared...

05:55.730 --> 05:59.760
She feels joy from the most
trivial things you do!

05:59.760 --> 06:01.840
And she also feels sad
and gets hurt!

06:01.840 --> 06:06.040
She has all the charms,
but why do you reject her?!

06:06.040 --> 06:08.200
Just accept her love!

06:08.200 --> 06:11.690
Then she will feel redeemed!

06:11.690 --> 06:13.710
It's all your fault!

06:18.390 --> 06:19.770
It's all your fault...

06:20.500 --> 06:21.690
...that I...

06:22.270 --> 06:23.950
...and she...

06:27.090 --> 06:29.120
We feel odious and hateful...

06:29.550 --> 06:31.760
But...

06:31.760 --> 06:34.080
We...

06:34.620 --> 06:36.040
We care for you...

06:37.700 --> 06:41.520
Block off the stairs.
Don't let the bandit near our Goddess.

06:41.520 --> 06:42.210
Sir!

06:42.210 --> 06:45.730
Send the garrison above down.
Track her down to the east.

06:45.730 --> 06:46.540
Sir!

06:51.760 --> 06:54.590
I guess my methods won't do.

06:55.950 --> 06:59.950
I wanted her to stay
the sublime Goddess...

07:00.940 --> 07:04.820
I didn't want her to stoop so low,
becoming the lowlife that I am...

07:05.860 --> 07:07.840
That's why I wanted to kill you.

07:08.450 --> 07:10.850
I wanted to stop her
from fulfilling her wish.

07:10.850 --> 07:11.860
But...

07:13.650 --> 07:15.130
I can always hear it...

07:16.390 --> 07:17.960
A sobbing voice...

07:18.380 --> 07:22.090
I've never heard of such voice...

07:22.090 --> 07:25.070
She's suffering! She's hurtful!

07:25.070 --> 07:28.550
At this rate,
she will never be redeemed!

07:28.870 --> 07:31.210
Take a hint already!

07:31.210 --> 07:34.180
If you don't notice it yourself,
it's all pointless.

07:34.180 --> 07:37.520
Even if you know through the words of me,
an impostor, it's pointless!

07:38.770 --> 07:42.980
Please! Notice it, Bell...

07:44.880 --> 07:47.700
She will never become anyone.

07:48.050 --> 07:49.860
You can take pity on me.

07:49.860 --> 07:51.500
I'm fine with you sympathising me.

07:51.940 --> 07:53.700
As long as you accept me...

07:54.260 --> 07:56.580
There's no such girl here.

07:57.030 --> 07:59.540
I really love you.

08:01.670 --> 08:03.020
I love him...

08:06.220 --> 08:08.730
So you're... Syr?

08:09.800 --> 08:11.060
And Lady Freya...

08:11.910 --> 08:13.090
She's Syr too?

08:22.590 --> 08:23.400
Here.

08:24.550 --> 08:26.440
It's the Goddess' knife?

08:29.590 --> 08:31.230
So you meant to...

08:31.230 --> 08:33.620
Yes, this was my original plan.

08:35.490 --> 08:37.582
Horn, what are you...

08:41.150 --> 08:42.821
My...

08:42.970 --> 08:45.160
I've betrayed the Goddess twice.

08:45.850 --> 08:48.960
I deceived her, disobeyed her,

08:49.380 --> 08:51.260
and tried to kill you...

08:51.260 --> 08:54.260
That's why I must atone with death...

08:54.260 --> 08:57.870
We can still fix you up!
I'll go get Heith!

08:57.870 --> 09:02.770
Take care of her feelings, and heart...

09:04.450 --> 09:06.230
O unreachable stairway.

09:06.760 --> 09:08.190
O forbidden gate.

09:08.590 --> 09:12.920
Today, this day,
my body will exceed the heavenly law.

09:12.920 --> 09:16.360
Empty soul, unworthy desire.

09:17.060 --> 09:21.790
Descend in order of this traded true name,
Daughter of the Gods.

09:22.230 --> 09:23.530
Vana Seith.

09:32.330 --> 09:33.550
Syr...

09:35.050 --> 09:36.760
It hurts.

09:37.300 --> 09:42.370
I didn't want to know this feeling,
I couldn't hold it...

09:42.370 --> 09:44.980
I thought I'd thrown away
my own self...

09:45.670 --> 09:48.390
But why does it hurt so much?

09:49.330 --> 09:52.050
It's not Horn...

09:52.910 --> 09:54.660
It's her words.

09:58.640 --> 10:02.290
I thought I'd be done with only you,

10:02.700 --> 10:06.750
but I hurt so many people precious to me...

10:07.170 --> 10:08.710
It's freezing...

10:09.400 --> 10:11.670
Syr was all but a lie,

10:12.070 --> 10:14.130
but I felt like losing my head!

10:15.400 --> 10:19.350
This isn't what I wanted, you know?

10:20.550 --> 10:22.660
My wish...

10:26.000 --> 10:27.270
End it.

10:27.810 --> 10:30.440
I don't want to go crazy anymore...

10:30.440 --> 10:31.990
I don't want to be bound anymore...

10:33.550 --> 10:35.450
So please...

10:35.970 --> 10:38.720
Save me, Bell...

10:39.960 --> 10:41.060
I will.

10:41.700 --> 10:43.040
Even if I...

10:44.410 --> 10:46.000
...end up hurting you again.

10:51.800 --> 10:53.670
I'll save both of you.

10:56.310 --> 10:58.140
Ottar, spare Horn.

10:58.820 --> 11:02.350
I can't just let her disappear
from me out of the blue.

11:02.350 --> 11:03.500
But...

11:04.310 --> 11:06.040
I don't mind.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.520
Get the other guards out of here.

11:08.170 --> 11:08.850
Yes.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.440
Bell...

11:16.440 --> 11:17.950
IS IT WRONG TO TRY TO
PICK UP GIRLS IN A DUNGEON? V

11:19.020 --> 11:21.490
Here's your potatoes.

11:22.290 --> 11:24.290
- Here it is!
- I want some too!

11:25.040 --> 11:26.530
Yay!

11:28.360 --> 11:30.600
My, we're selling like crazy tonight.

11:30.600 --> 11:32.960
But I guess it's time now?

11:41.710 --> 11:43.170
Hand over the girl.

11:43.680 --> 11:45.010
I won't kill her.

11:45.380 --> 11:46.600
It's Lady Freya's orders.

11:48.160 --> 11:49.670
Lady Freya?

11:52.270 --> 11:53.820
You're here, Bell.

11:54.160 --> 11:56.110
Horn had to spice things up...

11:56.810 --> 12:00.280
I was this close to having you accept me.

12:00.820 --> 12:02.740
So you were Syr, huh?

12:03.380 --> 12:04.890
Correct.

12:05.470 --> 12:08.550
But Syr never existed.

12:09.010 --> 12:10.960
It's all part of my acting.

12:11.540 --> 12:14.580
It was fun killing time at the pub.

12:14.580 --> 12:16.860
I got to meet Ryu and the others too.

12:17.450 --> 12:19.960
But it was all just role-playing.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.990
Just prolonging the game.

12:21.990 --> 12:23.130
Syr.

12:23.130 --> 12:25.680
There's no such girl.
Stop that.

12:25.680 --> 12:27.350
No. Syr.

12:28.970 --> 12:33.580
If it was all just an act,
then why were you crying back there?

12:34.910 --> 12:37.270
It's also role-playing.

12:37.270 --> 12:40.050
A girl dumped by his man would surely...

12:40.050 --> 12:40.960
Lies.

12:41.950 --> 12:44.660
Syr was actually there.

12:44.660 --> 12:47.710
You were actually hurt back there.

12:49.420 --> 12:52.920
Act with passion, and you'll end up
getting absorbed in it.

12:53.770 --> 12:57.300
Syr was also happy
with this present.

13:02.940 --> 13:04.790
But I don't need it anymore.

13:05.330 --> 13:06.780
Enough playing games.

13:07.700 --> 13:09.600
Syr is dead.

13:09.600 --> 13:11.040
She's not!

13:11.040 --> 13:13.310
She told me to save her!

13:13.790 --> 13:16.540
It's mostly part of Horn's feelings.

13:16.540 --> 13:19.280
Just some impurity in her magic.

13:19.670 --> 13:22.670
Also, save her?
Look who's speaking.

13:23.090 --> 13:25.410
Aren't you the one who rejected Syr?

13:25.410 --> 13:27.290
You hurt her yourself,
yet you're saying...

13:27.290 --> 13:29.530
That's right, I rejected her.

13:29.530 --> 13:32.780
I hurt Syr... I hurt you!

13:34.030 --> 13:37.460
I made you that way.
I turned you so corrupt.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.880
That's why I'll save you!

13:39.230 --> 13:41.760
Do you even hear yourself?!

13:41.760 --> 13:44.270
Even gods aren't that egoist!

13:44.270 --> 13:46.590
You really are a hypocrite!

13:46.590 --> 13:49.020
Then what you're doing is also egoistic!

13:49.020 --> 13:51.340
You even involved the whole Orario!

13:52.420 --> 13:55.520
Scream all you want,
Syr doesn't exist.

13:55.520 --> 13:58.980
After all that passionate confession,
you're saying it's a lie?

13:58.980 --> 14:01.250
I refuse to believe that!

14:01.950 --> 14:06.600
Syr isn't a lie!
I won't let anyone pretend she never existed!

14:06.600 --> 14:08.910
I couldn't care less about your pride!

14:10.120 --> 14:12.960
Syr's confession was true!

14:12.960 --> 14:16.440
I won't let anyone deny it!
Not even you!

14:20.800 --> 14:24.020
How irritating!
This is unbearable!

14:24.020 --> 14:26.910
I've never felt like this ever.

14:26.910 --> 14:30.060
What can you do to save me, anyway!

14:30.870 --> 14:34.880
As you have guessed,
Orario is in the palm of my hand.

14:34.880 --> 14:37.510
The Hestia Familia,
and the Sword Princess too.

14:38.020 --> 14:41.240
You can become my enemy
should I wish for it too.

14:41.650 --> 14:45.600
Were I willing to do anything,
you would've fallen for me.

14:46.090 --> 14:48.900
You can't...

14:49.340 --> 14:52.030
You can't possibly save me...

14:54.920 --> 14:55.840
Ow!

14:57.170 --> 14:58.490
It's burning!

14:58.910 --> 15:00.940
The status I overwrote...

15:03.090 --> 15:04.220
Could it be...

15:05.550 --> 15:08.070
My body feels hot...

15:08.070 --> 15:09.560
I'm burning...

15:09.560 --> 15:12.560
The Torch's authority is in motion.

15:12.560 --> 15:15.030
What do you mean?

15:15.830 --> 15:17.380
It's too late.

15:17.830 --> 15:21.500
No matter what you puppets of Charm do,

15:21.500 --> 15:23.780
you can't put out the spreading flames.

15:24.320 --> 15:29.030
Hermes was aware he gave
Hestia a piece of advice.

15:29.030 --> 15:32.470
Hence, I trusted the Hermes Familia...

15:32.470 --> 15:35.370
...with delivering firewood throughout Orario.

15:35.370 --> 15:38.460
What?! That was just normal firewood...

15:38.460 --> 15:42.670
Exactly. The wood itself
isn't anything special.

15:43.070 --> 15:45.810
But along the way...

15:45.810 --> 15:49.180
Hestia's blood, ichor,
was dropped to the wood.

15:53.800 --> 15:55.140
So hot!

15:55.140 --> 15:57.350
My body feels so hot!

15:59.080 --> 16:01.580
Trying to set up a furnace
without thinking anything...

16:01.580 --> 16:03.820
Pretty well done if I say so.

16:06.320 --> 16:10.470
I just focused on what I was doing.

16:10.470 --> 16:13.540
Even if I felt something off,
I didn't doubt it.

16:13.540 --> 16:17.040
My memories wouldn't
be reset this way.

16:17.620 --> 16:20.580
The rest is up to you, Asfi.

16:21.920 --> 16:26.800
So cold! It's freezing up here, Asfi!

16:26.800 --> 16:29.830
I know we're doing this
to avoid the guards, but still!

16:29.830 --> 16:34.260
Please stay still!
Then why are you dressed like that!

16:34.260 --> 16:38.430
This isn't important,
but it's rare for us to team up!

16:38.430 --> 16:40.650
It really isn't important!

16:40.650 --> 16:46.850
If Freya simply turned the whole Orario
into mindless loyal puppets,

16:46.850 --> 16:48.450
then there'd be nothing we could do.

16:48.900 --> 16:50.830
But she couldn't.

16:50.830 --> 16:53.310
Orario is the hometown of heroes.

16:53.310 --> 16:58.100
If it loses its meaning,
it'll simply mean the end of the world.

16:58.100 --> 17:02.520
If she turns everyone into puppets,
o heroes will be born.

17:02.520 --> 17:06.164
In fact, Freya,
wanting to make Bell Cranel a hero,

17:06.164 --> 17:09.970
must maintain Orario's original function.

17:09.970 --> 17:14.164
That distortion is exactly our breakthrough.

17:15.310 --> 17:20.020
What are you saying, Ouranos?
What will happen now?!

17:20.836 --> 17:25.164
It begins with a recreation of the temple
that a certain goddess has in Heaven.

17:25.164 --> 17:29.480
The Goddess of the Altar of the Eternal Torch.

17:30.030 --> 17:32.240
Her name is Hestia.

17:33.290 --> 17:37.450
I've had enough of humouring you, Freya.

17:40.260 --> 17:42.370
What do you think, Lady Hestia?

17:42.710 --> 17:46.340
Yeah, there's not much I can do below,

17:46.340 --> 17:49.890
but there's something
I can do while preparing an altar.

17:58.180 --> 18:02.270
My ichor is dripping from
the firewood in the fireplace.

18:02.270 --> 18:03.850
It acts as an intermediary.

18:04.200 --> 18:07.440
This myriad of lights
equals the Goddess' Familia.

18:08.260 --> 18:11.050
I can recreate the temple
in the heavens like this.

18:12.200 --> 18:14.130
I am a Virgin Goddess.

18:14.130 --> 18:16.510
Bound not by the power of charm,

18:16.510 --> 18:18.470
one shall reject it greatly.

18:19.040 --> 18:22.350
Evil is desires, righteous is chastity.

18:22.710 --> 18:25.380
One shall disperse the curse
infecting the land.

18:26.230 --> 18:29.340
The crushing of evil, the Vesta.

18:31.150 --> 18:36.190
Freya, it was a mistake to leave Babel
so you could get to Bell.

18:37.090 --> 18:40.770
What you let empty
is the centre of the altar.

18:43.040 --> 18:45.880
Let's show them undying flames.

18:47.550 --> 18:50.360
Dios Aedes Vesta.

19:05.600 --> 19:07.610
You did it, Hestia.

19:13.340 --> 19:15.560
What was that light?

19:16.860 --> 19:20.060
Surrender yourself!
Lower your weapons!

19:22.190 --> 19:24.680
If you stick to your pride, then perish!

19:28.830 --> 19:30.590
I remember everything.

19:31.870 --> 19:34.780
Bell doesn't belong to the Freya Familia.

19:35.130 --> 19:37.220
No... No...

19:38.760 --> 19:41.990
Why did I act like that to Master Bell...

19:42.620 --> 19:44.500
What did I just do...

19:45.590 --> 19:48.210
Hey! It's no use crying about it now!

19:48.600 --> 19:53.040
If we don't hurry,
that greedy goddess will eat Bell alive!

19:54.800 --> 19:56.060
Let's go get them!

19:56.560 --> 19:58.140
We're Familia, after all!

19:58.140 --> 19:59.780
What's going on here, damn it?!

19:59.780 --> 20:01.380
How dare they do this!

20:01.380 --> 20:03.350
That Freya Familia!

20:03.350 --> 20:05.800
She may be a goddess,
but this is too much!

20:05.800 --> 20:07.480
This just won't do!

20:08.110 --> 20:10.890
I won't forgive Goddess Freya,

20:10.890 --> 20:13.400
and myself for saying that to Bell!

20:13.400 --> 20:13.930
Damn!

20:13.930 --> 20:15.110
You're kidding me!

20:20.240 --> 20:20.870
Come on!

20:20.870 --> 20:23.200
How dare she do this!

20:23.200 --> 20:27.290
Bell!

20:30.250 --> 20:31.720
Goddess?

20:31.720 --> 20:33.300
Sorry, Bell!

20:33.300 --> 20:38.090
I'm sorry for shrugging you off!
I'm a failure as a goddess!

20:38.090 --> 20:43.600
Goddess... Thank you.
I love you so much.

20:44.620 --> 20:46.800
Me too!

20:48.190 --> 20:50.600
Pseudo-recreation of a temple...

20:50.940 --> 20:52.960
So you did have a trick up your sleeve.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.320
You bet!

20:54.660 --> 20:56.250
All right, then.

20:56.250 --> 20:59.280
I will have MY Bell back.

21:01.010 --> 21:05.460
What's the plan now, Freya?
Say what you want, you still lose.

21:05.460 --> 21:09.500
Orario won't fall into your hands again,
and Bell won't be yours.

21:10.120 --> 21:12.360
Prepare to receive judgment!

21:15.760 --> 21:17.660
Serves you right, Freya!

21:17.660 --> 21:20.760
That's what you get for being cocky!
Just kick the bucket already!

21:21.100 --> 21:24.910
Why'd I hafta scream "Lady Freya!"
with hearts on my eyes?!

21:24.910 --> 21:29.940
Thought I'd already forced her
to not use her charm!

21:29.940 --> 21:34.150
Anyway, where do you think
is the common ground for this riot?

21:36.950 --> 21:39.270
I'm super pissed, though.

21:39.270 --> 21:44.070
The Guild won't surely allow
an all-out war that'll tilt Orario.

21:44.070 --> 21:46.850
Cause any chaos,
and it'll still be incomplete combustion.

21:46.850 --> 21:51.540
But it is impossible for adventurers
to build up intolerable resentment.

21:51.990 --> 21:55.320
Then there's only one way.

21:55.320 --> 21:56.500
Hestia.

21:59.380 --> 22:00.720
I want a War Game against you.

23:34.930 --> 23:35.770
WAR GAME

23:35.770 --> 23:38.070
WAR GAME
Next episode: War Game.

23:38.070 --> 23:40.900
WAR GAME
